---
---
<section>
  <h2 class="section-title">联系我</h2>
  <div class="contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-left">
      <p class="desc">无论是技术交流、项目合作还是随便聊聊，都欢迎联系我，通常 24 小时内回复。</p>
      <div class="methods">
        <button class="glow-card method" id="copy-email">
          <span class="m-icon">📧</span>
          <div class="m-info">
            <span class="m-label">邮箱</span>
            <span class="m-val">iambondgg@qq.com</span>
          </div>
          <span class="m-hint">点击复制</span>
        </button>
        <a href="https://github.com/" class="glow-card method" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="m-icon">🐙</span>
          <div class="m-info">
            <span class="m-label">GitHub</span>
            <span class="m-val">github.com/judy</span>
          </div>
          <span class="m-hint">访问 →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://fns.judy666.icu" class="glow-card method" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="m-icon">📝</span>
          <div class="m-info">
            <span class="m-label">笔记站</span>
            <span class="m-val">fns.judy666.icu</span>
          </div>
          <span class="m-hint">访问 →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal">
      <div class="t-bar">
        <i class="d r"></i><i class="d y"></i><i class="d g"></i>
        <span class="t-title">judy@homelab:~</span>
      </div>
      <div class="t-body">
        <p><b>❯</b> whoami</p>
        <p class="out">Judy · 计科毕业生 · 自建服务爱好者</p>
        <p><b>❯</b> cat /etc/motto</p>
        <p class="out">"代码是手段，解决问题才是目的。"</p>
        <p><b>❯</b> uptime</p>
        <p class="out">自 2020 年起，持续在线 ▌</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="toast" id="c-toast">✓ 邮箱已复制到剪贴板</div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .desc {
    font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 1.6vw, 0.95rem);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
  }
  .methods { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.8rem; }
  .method {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: inherit;
  }
  .m-icon { font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .m-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }
  .m-label { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .m-val { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .m-hint {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }
  .method:hover .m-hint { opacity: 1; }

  .terminal {
    background: rgba(10, 14, 26, 0.92);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  .t-bar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }
  .d { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .r { background: #ff5f57; } .y { background: #febc2e; } .g { background: #28c840; }
  .t-title { margin-left: 0.4rem; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.72rem; }
  .t-body { padding: 1rem 1.1rem; line-height: 1.9; }
  .t-body b { color: var(--accent-cyan); font-weight: 400; margin-right: 0.4rem; }
  .out { color: var(--accent-green); padding-left: 1.3rem; }

  .toast {
    position: fixed; bottom: 2rem; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--accent-green); color: #0a0e1a;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s;
    pointer-events: none; z-index: 10000;
  }
  .toast.show { opacity: 1; }
</style>

<script>
  document.getElementById('copy-email')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    await navigator.clipboard.writeText('iambondgg@qq.com');
    const t = document.getElementById('c-toast')!;
    t.classList.add('show');
    setTimeout(() => t.classList.remove('show'), 2000);
  });
</script>
